abstract: >-
  An open educational resource for undergraduate agricultural engineering
  students at the University of Sulaimani, Kurdistan Region of Iraq.
  It provides 14 lessons, practical GIS activities, browser-based formative
  quizzes, downloadable synthetic GIS datasets, and instructor guidance.
